## 19.3 Detection metrics

Calculate actual:

Precision = True positives / (True positives + False positives).

Recall = True positives / (True positives + False negatives).

F1 score = 2 × Precision × Recall / (Precision + Recall).

Also calculate:

- Merchant resolution accuracy.
- Merchant resolution coverage.
- Annual commitment detection accuracy.
- Price-change detection accuracy.
- Trial-event detection accuracy.

Keep metrics separated by test category.

A low merchant-resolution coverage with high matching accuracy is different from high coverage with many incorrect matches.

Display actual measured results.

Never invent successful performance percentages.

