# 26. WHAT MAKES DEBITLENS DIFFERENT?

The product must communicate the following positioning:

"Other financial applications may already detect recurring payments, remind users of renewals or alert them when subscription amounts change. DebitLens aims to connect those insights into one evidence-backed commitment workflow."

